Data in data/ is redistributed from public sources under each source's own
terms: FRED / Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis (BLS LAUS and CES, Census FT-900,
Federal Reserve H.10, Realtor.com, OECD MEI series) and the U.S. Bureau of
Transportation Statistics (Border Crossing/Entry Data). See data/MANIFEST.json
for the source of every file.
